    "显示状态": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Show status"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"显示状态"}}}},
    "暂时不能切换工作台": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cannot switch workspaces yet"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂时不能切换工作台"}}}},
    "更新失败，原有快照已保留。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Refresh failed. The previous snapshot was preserved."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新失败，原有快照已保留。"}}}},
    "最近更新优先": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Newest activity first"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近更新优先"}}}},
    "查看原条目": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open original item"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看原条目"}}}},
    "每个雷达工作台独立保存数据源、筛选和显示配置。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Each radar workspace keeps its own feed, filters and display settings."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每个雷达工作台独立保存数据源、筛选和显示配置。"}}}},
    "添加 PM Radar": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Add PM Radar"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"添加 PM Radar"}}}},
