    "请先结束语音笔记录音，再切换工作台。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Finish recording the voice note before switching workspaces."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先结束语音笔记录音，再切换工作台。"}}}},
    "请输入不含账号、参数或密钥的 HTTPS JSON 地址。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enter an HTTPS JSON URL without credentials, query parameters or keys."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请输入不含账号、参数或密钥的 HTTPS JSON 地址。"}}}},
    "这份快照中没有匹配的项目记录。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This snapshot has no matching project records."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这份快照中没有匹配的项目记录。"}}}},
    "这份快照中没有匹配的待处理项。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This snapshot has no matching action items."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这份快照中没有匹配的待处理项。"}}}},
    "配置数据源": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configure data source"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置数据源"}}}},
