    "声纹不可用，请重新录制，或关闭开关。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voiceprint unavailable. Record it again or turn this off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "声纹不可用，请重新录制，或关闭开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚未录制声纹。先完成录制才能开启。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No voiceprint recorded. Complete enrollment before enabling this."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未录制声纹。先完成录制才能开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在语音填入前比对，不影响语音记录；有效语音不足约 1 秒才保留文字供手动确认，1–2 秒照常比对。声纹只保存在本机、不上传、不备份；可能误判，不可用于身份验证。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checked only before inserting dictated text, not for voice notes. Speech shorter than about 1 second is held for manual confirmation; 1–2 seconds is checked normally. Voiceprints stay on this device, without upload or backup. Results can be wrong and must not be used for identity verification."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在语音填入前比对，不影响语音记录；有效语音不足约 1 秒才保留文字供手动确认，1–2 秒照常比对。声纹只保存在本机、不上传、不备份；可能误判，不可用于身份验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按顺序念 6 句，每句约 5–10 秒。前 3 句在安静环境，后 3 句请换到不同的日常环境（例如窗边或室外），正常音量说话。旧声纹保留至六句全部录完。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read 6 phrases in order, about 5–10 seconds each. Record the first 3 somewhere quiet, then move to another everyday setting, such as near a window or outdoors. Speak at your normal volume. Your previous voiceprint stays until all six are complete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按顺序念 6 句，每句约 5–10 秒。前 3 句在安静环境，后 3 句请换到不同的日常环境（例如窗边或室外），正常音量说话。旧声纹保留至六句全部录完。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
